join Thorinn leftmost
join vivian rightmost
if {Vivian.Interaction_phase} == 1:
	if {Vivian.New_Dialog} == true:
		vivian: Hey, you don’t look familiar. Are you a traveler?
		- Yes, I’m a traveling doctor. Is there something I can help you with?
			vivian: Actually, yes! I need help with something.
			set {Vivian.Interaction_phase} = 2
			jump 
		- Maybe. What’s it to you?
			vivian: I don’t mean to bother you, sir, but I really need someone’s help.
			set {Vivian.Interaction_phase} = 2
			jump 
		- Get out of my way, kid.
			vivian: I'm sorry I didn't mean to bother you, sir.
			set {Vivian.New_Dialog} = false
			set {Ian.find_ian_quest_avalible} = true
	else:
		Thorinn: Just passing by, never mind.
		vivian: That's allright, I hope someone else will help me.
elif {Vivian.Interaction_phase} == 2:
	if {Vivian.New_Dialog} == true:
		vivian: I need to court this guy. He’s the love of my life, but he’s been struggling lately. He can’t sleep well and has frequent stomach pain.
		vivian: I heard that certain herbal flowers can help with these issues, but I have trouble identifying them.
		vivian: I also can’t seem to find our physician. If you could gather them for me, I’d be so grateful!
		- Sure, any idea where I can find these herbs?
			vivian: Yes! You can find them near the pharmacy, the mountain, or the nearby forest. They’re scattered all around town.
			set {Vivian.flower_quest_accepted} = true
			set {Vivian.New_Dialog} = false
			[signal arg="Accept_flower_quest"]
		- No, I don’t have time to waste gathering herbs.
			vivian: That's allright, I hope someone else will help me.
			set {Vivian.New_Dialog} = false
			set {Ian.find_ian_quest_avalible} = true
	elif {Vivian.flower_quest_accepted} == true:
		vivian: Have you found the herbs yet?
		Thorinn: No, I’m still working on it.
		vivian: Good luck!
	else:
		Thorinn: Just passing by, never mind.
		vivian: That's allright, I hope someone else will help me.
elif {Vivian.Interaction_phase} == 3:
	if {Vivian.New_Dialog} == true:
		vivian: Have you found the herbs?
		Thorinn: Yes, here they are. Just put them in boiling water and the effect will be immediate.
		vivian: Wow, these are perfect! Thank you so much. If you ever need help, don’t hesitate to ask.
		- Actually can you help me?
			Thorinn: I'm looking for the pharmacist. Do you know where he lives?
			vivian: Yes, I do! He lives in the house just past the bridge, right above his pharmacy.
			[signal arg="start_find_ian_quest"]
		- Good luck with courting your friend
			set {Vivian.New_Dialog} = false
			set {Ian.find_ian_quest_avalible} = true
